    ev:"Goodman & Gilman's Pharmacological Basis of Therapeutics; Katzung's Basic and Clinical Pharmacology; Drug Discovery: A History (Sneader); DiMasi et al. Journal of Health Economics Drug Cost Estimates; FDA Drug Approval Process; ICH Guidelines"
